## V1 fallback availability

V1 (per-thread FA-2) remains in the codebase as a fallback. Set
`MFA_LCSA_KERNEL_VERSION=v1` to force V1 dispatch. Default is `v2` with
transparent V1 fallback when eligibility conditions don't hold:
- BT ≠ 32
- D ∉ {64, 128}
- dtype = bfloat16
- causal = true

